            "<strong>Aliasing</strong> is the single most important reference concept. After <code>Dog b = a;</code>, there is <em>one</em> Dog and two names for it. <code>b.setAge(5)</code> changes the Dog that <code>a</code> also points to. This surprises students every year.",
