            "<strong>Printing in toString.</strong> Return the String. Don't print it.",
            "<strong>Returning from a void method with a value.</strong> <code>return x;</code> in a void method — compile error. Bare <code>return;</code> is fine.",
            "<strong>Reading the FRQ verb wrong.</strong> \"Returns\" → return. \"Prints\" → println. They're different rubric points.",
