            "<strong>Using a for-header variable after the loop.</strong> Out of scope.",
            "<strong>Assuming a shadowed instance variable was changed.</strong> The local was changed. The field wasn't.",
            "<strong>Redeclaring a variable in the same scope.</strong> Compile error.",
